      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Vibe. Imbibe. Come alive with the songs you love.  You don’t need to be in New York, New Orleans, or Las Vegas to enjoy a classic, casual live music experience.  Arts On Piano Bar , presented by  Arts On / The Maple Ridge and Pitt Meadows Arts Council , returns with a new home at   The Loft at Meado"
      }
    ],
